app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

checks
  esc       esc     checks        on
  ctrl+r    ^r      rerun failed  off
  r         r       refresh       on
  o         o       browser       on
  enter     ↵       open          off
  up k      ↑/k     up            off
  down j    ↓/j     down          off
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up       off
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down     off
  home g    g/home  first         off
  end G     G/end   last          off
  A         A       annotations   off

detail
  up k            ↑/k     up           on
  down j          ↓/j     down         on
  pgup b          b/pgup  page up      on
  pgdown space f  f/pgdn  page down    on
  u ctrl+u        u       ½ page up    on
  d ctrl+d        d       ½ page down  on
  left h          ←/h     move left    on
  right l         →/l     move right   on
